/**
 * ============================================================================
 * COA UNIT 5 CASE STUDY — Google Apps Script backend (Code.gs)
 * ============================================================================
 * WHAT THIS IS:
 * Receives each submission from index.html, auto-scores the 13 MCQs against
 * the answer key below, writes ONE ROW to the "Responses" tab, and refreshes
 * the "Summary" tab (class % correct per question, per case) — project that
 * tab in class for the debrief.
 *
 *   [index.html on GitHub Pages] --POST JSON--> doPost(e) --score--> Sheet
 *
 * GENERATED by build.py from cases.py. The answer TEXT must match the option
 * text in index.html exactly — so edit cases.py and rebuild, never by hand.
 * ============================================================================
 */

